{"claim_id": "profit_first_direction_20260921:customer_facilitation", "claim": "FINRA 说明，券商撮合客户卖出持仓时，先行自营卖出与随后向客户买入的两腿未必都进入公开日文件，可能抬高表观 short-sale 比例。", "source_url": "https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/notices/information-notice-051019", "source_type": "regulatory_docs", "accessed_at": "2026-09-21", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-21T13:41:32.494303+00:00", "published_at": "2019-05-10", "status": "verified", "verification_method": "live_http_200_content_excerpt_and_sha256", "quote": "some offsetting buying activity related to reported short selling would not be reflected in the Daily File", "source_snapshot": "reports/research/intel/sources/20260921-direction/finra_notice.html", "source_sha256": "b3500509a0e6d668a56666eed317b78e2d15ab2c33f03a9f37bbc12720014e49", "applies_to": ["profit_first_direction", "internet_first"], "impact_on_spec": "将做市/客户订单撮合与知情看空分开；不预设高 short_volume_ratio 就代表看空。", "limitations": "解释一种交易机制，不代表每条记录均属做市，也不证明比例应该反向交易。"}
